{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43496","headline":"笙磬同音 · 无名氏","name":"笙磬同音","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笙磬闻何处，凄锵宛在东。\n激扬音自彻，高下曲宜同。\n历历俱盈耳，泠泠递散空。\n兽因繁奏舞，人感至和通。\n讵间洪纤韵，能齐搏拊功。\n四悬今尽美，一听辨移风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43496.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43496","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}